This repository contains original study notes plus two upstream public
codebases included as git submodules.

- docs/* notes: Apache-2.0, Yang1999code
- third_party/kai0: OpenDriveLab/kai0, Apache-2.0
- third_party/hil-serl: rail-berkeley/hil-serl, Apache-2.0

Kai0 data and model checkpoints, if downloaded separately from Hugging Face,
remain under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 according to the upstream project. This
repository does not vendor datasets or weights.
